fix: screenshot-reported bugs — raw JSON file content, research extraction, best-AI trigger

1. File-write writes raw JSON instead of content (Images 1, 8, 9)
   - validateStructuredAction now normalizes "action" field to "type"
   - Models that return {"action": "create_file"} instead of {"type": "create_file"}
     are now handled correctly
   - Also normalizes "description" to "rationale" as fallback

2. Research extraction failure (Image 5 — Messi age)
   - Improved research system prompt with explicit extraction rules:
     "If a snippet says 'Messi, 36', extract the age as 36"
     "Do NOT say 'I couldn't determine' when the answer is in the snippets"

3. Generic answer on "best AI model" (Image 3)
   - Added "best/top/most popular/leading/#1" patterns to research trigger
   - "Whats the best ai model" now triggers web research instead of
     answering from stale training data

4. "Save to workspace" triggering browser dialog (Images 11-12)
   - Root cause: CodeBlockWithActions calls onFileCreate which writes to
     the virtual workspace provider (localStorage-based in browser mode)
   - The browser download dialog was likely triggered by a different code
     path or a missing workspace provider. The normalize fix in #1 should
     resolve the primary file creation flow.
